  "goodToKnow": "Dermaßen means so much or to such an extent, an emphatic intensifier: Ich war dermaßen überrascht! It's often followed by a dass-clause: Es regnete dermaßen, dass die Straße überflutet war. Derart is a close synonym: derart teuer. Both are a bit stronger and more formal than so. From der + Maß (measure): to that measure. Note the ß after the long a."
